> genfunc fibonacci
fibonacci: a[n+2] = a[n+1] + a[n], a[0] = 0, a[1] = 1
  a[n] = sqrt(5)*((1 + sqrt(5))/2)^n/5 - sqrt(5)*((1 - sqrt(5))/2)^n/5
  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = x/(1 - x - x^2)    for |x| < (-1 + sqrt(5))/2
  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = (-1 + sqrt(5))/4 is 0.518927630227216, G = 0.518927630227215 (difference 1.1e-16)
> genfunc n^2
  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = (x + x^2)/(1 - 3x + 3x^2 - x^3)    for |x| < 1
  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = 1/2 is 6, G = 6 (difference 8.9e-16)
> genfunc 1/n!
  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = e^x    for every x
  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = 1/2 is 1.64872127070013, G = 1.64872127070013 (difference 4.4e-16)
> genfunc catalan
catalan: binom(2n, n)/(n + 1)
  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = (1 - sqrt(1 - 4x))/(2x)    for |x| < 1/4
  from the library: (1 - sqrt(1 - 4u))/(2u)
  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = 1/8 is 1.17157287525381, G = 1.17157287525381 (difference 2.2e-16)
> genfunc a[n+1] = 3a[n] + 1, a[0] = 0
  a[n] = 3^n/2 - 1/2
  G(x) = sum_{n>=0} a_n x^n = x/(1 - 4x + 3x^2)    for |x| < 1/3
  check: sum_n a_n x^n at x = 1/6 is 0.4, G = 0.4 (difference 5.6e-17)
